# now dhyan do, we can also use an optional ELSE to do something only after the loop fully ends , which means something like agr loop poora chale tbhi kaam kre, mtlb agr BREAK hojae beech me sirf tbhi ELSE execute ho to use kr skte... example se smjho:

str= "FACEBOOK"

for letter in str:
    if(letter=="E"):
        print("E found , loop breaks now")
        break
    print(letter)
else:
    print("end")  # we will see that ye wala END print nhi hoga, qki break ne loop ko exit kra diya loop poora nhi chala.. pr agr break na hota... to loop end hone pe ELSE k andar ka work execute hota


